  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1554865/description_4536c287-06f6-4e9c-9332-312e9bfccfbc.png\" alt=\"Drigo 附魔工具\" width=\"850\" height=\"164\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/17aeebc13d1a3219e7e518d7a7f22a49446d7a4a_0.webp\" alt=\"说明\" width=\"300\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此纹理包会根据工具上附着的特定附魔动态改变其实际纹理和模型。目前仅涵盖所有镐子，但我后续会为所有工具添加此功能。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1554865/description_2024e389-cef4-400e-be9f-0b5ecf225aca.png\" alt=\"Drigo 附魔工具 图片\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></p><hr><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a84a822e69f5e42576ea0631129332b714a27a0a_0.webp\" alt=\"链接\" width=\"170\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/drigo/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/159648c2-8de7-4641-a129-8d8c2d06bd9c/dee1zh0-f9e45f11-8ff2-4032-8215-72e54c647a9f.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..fjO_Mm_jiHcc42PG-UJYYuQBR8JPs7bX9NCjPIfOD6g&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"70\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fdrigo%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdNMHQhEsV5eId8RgQzyG0GNxBl2Gpb7OQ0y300mcCgU03FMk2DHKoVTJtGA7DA0-KZUEbkNDBAB14my7CItBw_pz5hwycDcHVS7IUNMNY4n7ATuEpK1MDdtL34KEh7Vd3lQiFl?key=Ts9sQSSfeNWwwKd7mSkTE4H1&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft\" width=\"70\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/link